# Order Creation Sequence Diagram - FA2

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant FC as Frontend
    participant OC as OrderController
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant CS as CartService
    participant ID as IdempotencyService
    participant DB as Database
    
    C->>FC: Add items to cart
    FC->>OC: POST /api/v1/cart/items
    OC->>CS: addToCart()
    CS->>DB: Save cart items
    DB-->>CS: Success
    CS-->>OC: Cart updated
    OC-->>FC: 201 Created
    
    C->>FC: Checkout and place order
    FC->>OC: POST /api/v1/orders (with idempotencyKey)
    OC->>OS: createOrder()
    OS->>ID: Check idempotency key
    ID->>DB: Query idempotency record
    DB-->>ID: Not found
    ID-->>OS: Proceed with creation
    
    OS->>CS: getCart()
    CS->>DB: Fetch cart with items
    DB-->>CS: Cart data
    CS-->>OS: CartResponse
    
    OS->>DB: Validate items & prices
    DB-->>OS: Current prices
    
    OS->>OS: Compute totals (subtotal + tax + delivery)
    OS->>DB: Create Order
    OS->>DB: Create OrderItems with snapshots
    OS->>DB: Create OrderStatusEvent (PLACED)
    OS->>DB: Create IdempotencyRecord
    
    OS-->>OC: OrderResponse
    OC-->>FC: 201 Created
    FC-->>C: Order placed successfully
```
